KNOWN BUGS, PROBLEMS :
------------------------------

- nmblookup needs debug level >0 in smb.conf (fixed in samba-2.0.4)

- On early 2.2.x kernel, the dummy network driver may
  disable the broadcast functionality of smbclient and nmblookup:
  disable the dummy network driver or upgrade kernel

- smbmount from smbfs package (2.0 Kernel) does not support encrypted passwords

- all versions of smbmount have problems with "weird" names in share name and mount points,
  this can prevent mount or break mtab file, so the mount list is incorrectly updated,
  this is also a problem for "RootMountDir/machine/share" calculated mount points

- smbmount (2.2 Kernel) does not find smbmnt if it is not in your path

- I don't like the horizontal lines near favourite hosts without shares (bug or feature in gtk+1.2.x)

- poor browsing results with some windows hosts in network (see README)

- smbclient 2.0.x only lists about 500 servers per group (fixed in samba-2.0.4)

- warnings while showing tooltips with gtk+ 1.2.5 (gtk+ problem)
